 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Doumo, Yuusha no Chichi desu. ~Kono Tabi wa Gusoku ga Gomeiwaku o Kakete, Moushiwake Arimasen.~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "どうも、勇者の父です。～この度は愚息がご迷惑を掛けて、申し訳ありません。～"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Doumo, Yuusha no Chichi desu. ~Kono Tabi ha Gusoku ga Gomeiwaku wo Kakete, Moushiwake Arimasen.~"
   },
   {
    "en": "Hello, I'm the Hero's Father.: I'm Sorry for All the Trouble My Foolish Son Has Caused You."
   },
   {
    "en": "Hello, I Am the Hero's Father.: I Am Sorry for the Trouble My Stupid Son Has Caused."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Croix, who works as a lumberjack in a remote village, spends peaceful days with his beautiful wife, Wiel, and his only son, Alka. One day, Alka receives an oracle that he is the only one who can defeat the Demon King, the \"Hero\", and together with his fiancé Saya, he sets out on a journey to subjugate the Demon King... I spent my days as a lumberjack with pride.\n\nHowever, one day, three years after receiving the oracle, Saya returned to the village in tatters. From Saya's mouth, we are told about how Alka is failing in his authority as a hero, and is told that he does whatever he pleases without saving the world... to wake up his stupid son. Spank him with your strongest fist!!",
   "ja": "２メートル超の巨躯＆筋骨隆々なクロアは、清楚で美人な妻ウィエルと大事な一人息子アルカと共に辺境の村で木こりとして生活していた。ある日、アルカが魔王を討伐する勇者であるという神託を受ける。重責を感じながらも勇者になる決意を固めたアルカは許嫁であるサーヤと旅に出る。それから三年後、サーヤがやつれた姿で帰ってきた。サーヤからアルカが勇者としての権威をチラつかせて好き放題していると聞き、クロアは激怒し決心する。謝ったところでもう遅い。"
  },
